    # Min Price Fraction Pair is the same bytes whichever arm the model names: its arms lay them out alike and differ only in what they are called and what they mean, which Min Price Fraction Indicator says (Min Price Negative Whole Pair, Min Price Negative Ten Pair, Min Price Negative Hundred Pair, Min Price Negative Thousand Pair, Min Price Negative Ten Thousand Pair, Min Price Negative Hundred Thousand Pair, Min Price Negative Million Pair, Min Price Numeric Pair). They are parsed as MinPriceNumericPair, so which arm applies is left to what is built on the definition.
