    # Tick Price Fraction Pair is the same bytes whichever arm the model names: its arms lay them out alike and differ only in what they are called and what they mean, which Tick Price Fraction Indicator says (Tick Price Negative Whole Pair, Tick Price Negative Ten Pair, Tick Price Negative Hundred Pair, Tick Price Negative Thousand Pair, Tick Price Negative Ten Thousand Pair, Tick Price Negative Hundred Thousand Pair, Tick Price Negative Million Pair, Tick Price Numeric Pair). They are parsed as TickPriceNumericPair, so which arm applies is left to what is built on the definition.
    tick_price_fraction_pair: TickPriceNumericPair;
};

